			"date": "2023-10-18T17:00:17.411Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://mastodon.social/@khalidabuhakmeh\" class=\"u-url mention\">@<span>khalidabuhakmeh</span></a></span> do you mean the editor ecosystem or the framework ecosystem? I’m not sure. I’m tempted to blame the erosion of privacy norms in the US. EU folks seem to take a more principled approach, thankfully.</p>",
