			"date": "2023-10-18T17:07:17.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> Well, mostly the editor ecosystem, but I fear the line between the two begins to blur when you talk about LSP implementations.</p><p>Most LSP implementations have a thick veneer of VSCode around them, which, imho reduces choice in tooling for the majority of folks.</p>",
